  "Generate shell completion scripts for your shell.\n\nTo load completions:\n\n  bash:\n    source \u003c(fss completion bash)\n\n  zsh:\n    fss completion zsh \u003e \"${fpath[1]}/_fss\"\n\n  fish:\n    fss completion fish | source\n\n  powershell:\n    fss completion powershell | Out-String | Invoke-Expression": "",
