  "Undo a prior --include-stashbox import using the changelog": "",
  "Undo changes recorded in fss-stashbox-changelog.json for one or more scenes.\n\nReverts: title, date, urls (the added ones), tags (the added ones), performers\n(the added ones).\n\nNOT reverted (limitations of what the changelog stores):\n  - details: only a 60-char preview is recorded; can't restore the original.\n  - cover:   the original cover URL was never recorded.\n\nDefault is dry-run — pass --apply to actually write changes.": "",
  "Usage:": "",
  "Use \"%s [command] --help\" for more information about a command.": "",
  "Walk a directory of video files, match them against FSS scene metadata,\nand write .nfo sidecar files alongside each matched video.\n\nThe .nfo files can be picked up by Stash via the community NFO scraper.\n\nDefault is dry-run — shows what would be written. Pass --apply to write.": "",
